{
  "id": "1SA.27",
  "number": "27",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samweli 27",
  "verseCount": 12,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi aba bugusta fuga Filisti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayi Dawdi aba jeadaanyi, “Eaweecheanjagi gayghabwaran Sawli; ak ea manda gidang'al gideaba gaydawapta dawa ng'eanyiida Filisti; ak abeeda gaygabur Sawli aba gassoodeanyu aba jeeda moonghajeega Israeli, ak gaydamng'awa geatindaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghang'eat Dawdi ak gawa, niny sea fih bughalaji lah, ea ghwahita heeda Akishi orjeeda Maoki, was sugoocheanda Gati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwandeayi Dawdi sea Akishi aba Gati, niny sea fugaaschi, giliwas sih ea fugeaba gheanyi, sea Dawdi ea gadeamgaaschi asiyeenya, Ahinoamu bea ng'eanyiida Yesreeli, sea Abigaeli bea Garmeli, was masinung'weanda Nabali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea geerukusa Sawli gideaba niwaapta Dawdi gawa Gati, ea mudu gahoona wuuh gicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Dawdi Akishi, “Iinaanyaschi alooheeda aba madeeda gheanyangaagu, gigoonyean mujiineani mwanang' jea deabiida; aba gideaba ghwasaan inyas gaygoobiida siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda jeeda mujiineeda sugoocheanda sea ang'iing'i?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eada eaweedida ghoadaw Akishi niny mujiineeda Siklagi; ak ghoah Siklagi heeda ambal sugoocheanda Yuda ea ghoah ghamneawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mooneeda askwearjoojiga abiideewa Dawdi jeeda ng'eanyiida Filisti gweayda gil ea sheeh ang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwascheang'da Dawdi sea fugaaschi, ak gwasham fuga Geshuri, ea fuga Girsi, ea fuga Amaleki; aba gideaba suh fuga ghayi abiita ng'eanyiita, ea ghwahita Shuri, ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabwar Dawdi fugeaba ng'eanyiita gicha, ak ea moabuuda ng'eedeeni majeek ghana gatmooda, ak ghwaat gisilga, ea heewga, ea digeeniga, ea ngamiya, ea hang'weaka, ak gabiigu heeda Akishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoanyaashta Akishi nea gwayeesha, “Gwachi gooweayi abwara yeenu?” Ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha niny, “Geabwarji Negebooda Yuda,” ghana “Negebooda Yerameli,” ghana “Negebooda Geni”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea moabuuda Dawdi siisi majeek ng'eedeeda ghana gatmooda ak ea manda siida jea gabiikta Gati nea gwayi, “Adiidu ghoahaaktaneasa nea gwayi, ‘Nih gidasinda Dawdi gil.’” Ak ea giduurji seareadaanyi damanyoojiga sean mideewa ng'eanyiida Filisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamwas Akishi Dawdi, nea ghaghay gili, “Ninyareas muuchi fugaaschi bea Israeli; asi gayghoah siideanyu bea gadiyeeda damanda manda muudeanooda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
